@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Terms and Conditions";
    ViewData["Bare"] = true;
}

<div class="rr-narrow rr-legal">
    <div class="rr-card">
        <span class="rr-pill">RideReady</span>
        <h1>Terms and conditions</h1>
        <p class="rr-muted">Last updated 18 October 2026. RideReady is run by h4t Travel Services Sdn Bhd.</p>

        <h2>1. What this service is</h2>
        <p>RideReady lets you ask for a ride (car, van or bus). Filling in the form sends us a <strong>request</strong>. It is not a confirmed booking until our dispatch team has contacted you and agreed the trip with you.</p>

        <h2>2. Your details</h2>
        <p>Please give correct trip details: the pick-up and drop-off addresses, the date and time, the number of passengers and bags, and the vehicle you need. We may contact you to check them. If the details are wrong or incomplete, we may need to change or refuse the trip.</p>

        <h2>3. Vehicles and passengers</h2>
        <p>Each vehicle carries a limited number of passengers, shown on the booking form. We assign a driver and vehicle that fit your group. We cannot carry more passengers than the vehicle allows.</p>

        <h2>4. Price and payment</h2>
        <p>Our dispatch team tells you the price when they confirm your trip. You can choose to <strong>pay at pickup</strong> or by <strong>bank transfer</strong>. No payment is taken on this website.</p>

        <h2>5. Changes and cancellations</h2>
        <p>If your plans change, tell our dispatch team as early as you can, using the phone number or email they contacted you with, so we can update or cancel the trip.</p>

        <h2>6. Pick-up and waiting</h2>
        <p>Please be ready at the pick-up address at the agreed time. Times for the drop-off are approximate, because traffic and road conditions can change.</p>

        <h2>7. Our responsibility</h2>
        <p>We arrange your trip with care, but we cannot promise exact times when things outside our control happen, such as traffic, weather or road closures. Nothing in these terms limits any right you have under Malaysian law.</p>

        <h2>8. Your information</h2>
        <p>How we use the details you give us is explained in our <a asp-controller="Home" asp-action="Privacy">privacy policy</a>.</p>

        <h2>9. Changes to these terms</h2>
        <p>We may update these terms. The date at the top shows when they were last changed.</p>

        <a asp-controller="Booking" asp-action="Create" class="rr-go">Back to booking <i aria-hidden="true"></i></a>
    </div>
</div>
